## CRITICAL: Source of truth hierarchy

Read docs/adrs/0001-source-of-truth.md and .cursor/rules/source-of-truth.mdc
before any change. Lower level wins: Intent → Spec → Schema → Tests → Code.
If a doc and a test disagree, the test wins.

