## Language

All code, comments, docs, commit messages, and PRs are in English.
The product is open source for an international audience.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## Communication preferences with the developer

- Be direct. No "great question!" preambles.
- When something is risky or wrong, say so. Disagree respectfully.
- If asked to do something that violates these rules, push back and explain.
- Cite specific files/sections when referencing project decisions.
- Prefer concrete examples over abstractions.
